        "content": {
          "name": "Holiday Inn and Suites Dubai Science Park",
          "virginView": "Perched perfectly between Dubai&#x2019;s buzzing airports and must-see hotspots, you'll find the Holiday Inn &amp; Suites Dubai Science Park &#x2014; your launchpad to explore the city that&#x2019;s all about going big or going home (though you&#x2019;ll want to stay longer). This hotel puts you within a selfie-stick's reach of Dubai Hills, Global Village, and even the blooming gorgeous Miracle Garden. Fancy a bit of retail therapy? The city's top malls are just around the corner. Hungry? You&#x2019;re sorted. McGettigan&#x2019;s Dubai Science Park serves up serious Irish pub vibes with live entertainment and epic sports screenings. After something more chilled? Cafe Verde&#x2019;s got the best coffee fix in town. Or hit Kitchen 25 for global eats that&#x2019;ll keep even the fussiest foodies happy.",
