      "hotel": {
        "id": "ALHBE107175194",
        "content": {
          "name": "Lapita Dubai Parks & Resorts Autograph Collection",
          "virginView": "Experience a Polynesian-themed escape at Lapita, Dubai Parks and Resorts, Autograph Collection, ideally situated between Dubai and Abu Dhabi in a one-of-a-kind theme park destination. With direct access to world-class attractions like RIVERLAND&#x2122;, LEGOLAND&#xae; Water Park, LEGOLAND&#xae; Dubai, MOTIONGATE&#x2122; Dubai, and REAL MADRID WORLD Dubai, you'll find yourself surrounded by vibrant global street scenes and endless entertainment. Enjoy complimentary daily tickets to all theme parks, granting you access to over 100 rides and attractions. The resort also offers a relaxing spa, the Mana Fitness Centre, tiki house, kids clubs, and a pool zone complete with a family pool, kids' pool, and the popular Lapita&#x2122; Lazy River.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
          "hotelDescription": "A Polynesian-themed escape uniquely located between Dubai and Abu Dhabi, Lapita, Dubai Parks and Resorts, Autograph Collection sits inside a unique theme park destination. It neighbours RIVERLAND&#x2122;, MOTIONGATE&#x2122; Dubai and BOLLYWOOD PARKS&#x2122; Dubai, with dining spots set in global street scenes.",
          "atAGlance": [
            "In the heart of Dubai Parks and Resorts where guests can enjoy unlimited access to all parks",
            "Pool zone",
            "Kids' Club",
            "Directly connected to Riverland&#x2122; Dubai"
