    {
      "hotel": {
        "id": "H0366",
        "content": {
          "name": "The Ritz-Carlton, Dubai",
          "virginView": "A gem of a hotel, the spectacular Ritz-Carlton, Dubai has a wealth of amenities. Guests can enjoy a total of six swimming pools, including two exclusively for children (happily set in the shade!) and one solely for adults. There&#x2019;s a choice of rooms and suites, including Club rooms with access to the Club Lounge with benefits such as premium alcohol served from 12:00pm-10:00pm and five food presentations! The hotel's Italian restaurant Splendido is something of a local legend. But don't miss Amaseena, their magical tented Bedouin village set right beside the sea, serving traditional regional specialities that can be enjoyed whilst listening to the haunting background strains of the oud and the tabla. As all first-class hotels in Dubai do, this hotel overlooks its own stretch of private beach, where pristine white sands are lapped gently by azure waters. A wonderful place to relax, topping up your tan perhaps, indulging in a variety of water sports or simply reading that book you&#x2019;ve been wanting to for ages now! There are plenty of shaded areas too, private nooks to call your own, and unbeatable service from the La Baie Lounge. All of this, plus an indulgent spa, exciting kids club and a great location, ensures a holiday you&#x2019;ll remember forever!",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
          "hotelDescription": "A gem of a hotel, the spectacular Ritz-Carlton, Dubai has a wealth of amenities. Guests can enjoy a total of six swimming pools, including two exclusively for children (happily set in the shade!). There&#x2019;s a choice of rooms and suites, all furnished to impeccably high standards, with private balconies facing the Arabian Gulf. Its Italian restaurant Splendido is something of a local legend, and there is also a contemporary Asian restaurant Blue Jade and a sophisticated lounge offering unique flavour combinations from around Asia! All of this, plus Amaseena, their magical tented Bedouin village, set right beside the sea and serving traditional regional specialities, to be enjoyed whilst listening to the haunting background strains of the oud and the tabla.",
          "atAGlance": [
            "Intimate private beach resort with 9 restaurants and bars",
            "Interconnecting family rooms available",
            "6 pools including 2 exclusively for children",
            "Fantastic kids facilities and daily access to Ritz Kids Club",
            "Access to Marriott Half Board Dine Around with amazing choices from 120 restaurants",
            "Exclusive Club Lounge with 5 food presentations and 10 hours of free flow of alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages"
          ],
          "location": {
            "lat": 25.082415,
            "lon": 55.137245
          },
