      "hotel": {
        "id": "H0352",
        "content": {
          "name": "Grand Hyatt Dubai Resort & Waterpark",
          "virginView": "Grand Hyatt Dubai offers a unique 5-star city resort experience in the heart of Dubai, featuring a 20,000 square meter waterpark where guests can enjoy the perfect blend of luxury, adventure, and relaxation &#x2014; all with the city&#x2019;s iconic attractions just moments away.&#xa0; &#xa0;Blending family-friendly facilities with authentic Arabian charm, this iconic 37-acre urban resort, surrounded by lush landscaped gardens, offers a peaceful oasis within Dubai&#x2019;s vibrant metropolis. The hotel features 710 spacious and elegantly designed rooms and suites, 12 dining destinations, an indoor lap pool, Dubai&#x2019;s largest outdoor pool, as well as a shaded toddler pool for little guests.&#xa0; &#xa0;Spanning 20,000 square meters, the Grand Hyatt Dubai Waterpark features 16 exhilarating rides and attractions designed to delight the entire family. From thrilling waterslides and a lazy river to the region&#x2019;s first Triple Flow Rider, there is something for every adventure seeker and sun-soaker. For those seeking exclusivity and relaxation, the magnificent wave pool with pristine sand brings the beach to the heart of the city &#x2014; complete with private cabanas and premium service for an elevated experience.&#xa0; &#xa0;Make the most of your stay with a variety of family-friendly activities. Kids will love meeting and feeding the ducks, while Roli Poli Kids Club provides a haven for the little ones to unleash their creativity, make new friends, and have exciting adventures.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
          "hotelDescription": "This amazing leisure hotel boasts stunning views of Dubai Creek and is a world of entertainment and dining, with a fabulous pool complex.",
          "atAGlance": [
            "Dubai City location with a resort environment",
            "Fantastic pool complex",
            "Wide range of dining options",
            "Award-winning spa"
          ],
