        "id": "H0355",
        "content": {
          "name": "Le Royal Meridien Beach Resort & Spa",
          "virginView": "One of Dubai's premier resorts, Le Royal M&#xe9;ridien Beach Resort &amp; Spa sits in a prime location on Jumeirah Beach, boasting superb views of the Arabian Gulf and features 19 acres of beautifully landscaped gardens. Guests can enjoy refurbished contemporary, stylish rooms and a selection of internationally acclaimed restaurants and bars. With options ranging from Pan-Asian to Mexican cuisine, there&#x2019;s something to satisfy every palate.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
          "hotelDescription": "One of Dubai's premier resorts, Le Royal M&#xe9;ridien Beach Resort &amp; Spa features a Roman-themed spa, contemporary bedrooms and beautifully landscaped gardens. It's also in a prime location on Jumeirah Beach, overlooking the beach and boasting superb views of the Arabian Gulf.",
          "atAGlance": [
            "One of Dubai's premier resorts on Jumeirah Beach",
            "Spa",
            "Water sports",
            "Le M&#xe9;ridien Family Kids Club",
            "Easy access to The Walk JBR"
          ],
