    {
      "hotel": {
        "id": "JP06331B76841",
        "content": {
          "name": "Atlantis The Royal",
          "virginView": "The new iconic landmark in Dubai is here, and it&#x2019;s unlike any other hotel you&#x2019;ve seen before. If you thought Atlantis, The Palm was impressive (and we agree it is!), then this addition to the Atlantis portfolio will redefine your perspective of luxury and innovation. Atlantis The Royal is where impossible becomes possible, and luxury mixes with experience, challenging the boundaries of imagination. It&#x2019;s all about space, natural sunlight and feeling like you can quite literally reach the clouds. Speaking of clouds, Cloud 22 brings you a rooftop pool club that&#x2019;s on another level, literally! Book a private cabana with your own plunge pool, and enjoy an exquisite cocktail with even better views as the sun moves across the horizon and the music goes up a notch.\n\nThe alluring design of the hotel ensures complete privacy in all room types, 44 of which are available with private infinity pools. On arrival, the magnificent lobby is designed around the 4 natural elements, as you&#x2019;re welcomed by Droplets, the towering lobby sculpture inspired by the first drop of rain in the desert. And whilst the hotel is full of striking features, bespoke artwork, and large aquariums, it&#x2019;s the little touches that will also take your breath away. Your bed will be separated from the bathroom by a glass wall that frosts over at a single touch. From your balcony the views across The Palm and Dubai&#x2019;s skyline are exquisite, but ultimately you won&#x2019;t need to venture that far with the endless lists of fun, food and frolics on offer here! 17 restaurants each tell their own story, AWAKEN Wellness will have you revitalised in no time, and the nightlife will have you dancing until the early hours. From fountain shows to fire shows, one of the largest jellyfish tanks you&#x2019;ll ever see, and waterslides galore, Atlantis The Royal is the place where something incredible happens at every minute.&#xa0;\n",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5+",
          "hotelDescription": "",
          "atAGlance": [
            "Brand new hotel located next door to Atlantis, The Palm, with full access to all facilities",
            "Luxury suites with private infinity pools available",
            "Complimentary breakfast included",
            "Sky infinity pool and adults-only beach club",
            "17 restaurants including 8 by Celebrity Chefs"
          ],
          "location": {
            "lat": 25.13923,
            "lon": 55.12708
          },
          "parentLocation": "Dubai Beach, Dubai",
