    {
      "hotel": {
        "id": "JP04723258047",
        "content": {
          "name": "Sheraton Jumeirah Beach Resort",
          "virginView": "Welcome to the Sheraton Jumeirah Beach Resort - where Dubai's legendary glamour meets chilled-out beachfront vibes. This isn&#x2019;t just a hotel; it&#x2019;s your personal ticket to living the high life in one of the world&#x2019;s most exciting cities. Let&#x2019;s start with the location. Tucked right on Jumeirah Beach, it&#x2019;s got one of the best spots in Dubai. Powder-soft sands? Check. Views of the glittering Arabian Gulf? Oh, absolutely. And if you fancy some retail therapy or a stroll down the iconic promenade, Dubai Marina&#x2019;s just a short wander away. When it comes to the hotel itself, you&#x2019;ll feel like you&#x2019;ve stepped into a desert oasis. The lush gardens are palm tree paradise, perfect for lounging with a cocktail in hand while the kids splash around in the pool. Oh, and did we mention the private beach? Yep, it&#x2019;s all yours to soak up that year-round sunshine. Foodies, get ready. From Middle Eastern meze to fresh seafood straight off the grill, the dining here is next-level. And when the sun dips behind the skyline, there&#x2019;s no better place to sip a sundowner than on the beachfront terrace. Pure bliss. For those who love a bit of R&amp;R (who doesn&#x2019;t?), the resort&#x2019;s spa will have you floating on cloud nine in no time. Think soothing massages, rejuvenating facials, and plenty of \"me time.\"\n",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
          "hotelDescription": "",
          "atAGlance": [
            "Situated on JBR's \"The Walk\", close to Dubai Marina",
            "Stylishly designed rooms and suites",
            "Kids pool area and family-oriented services",
            "World-class dining options"
