        "id": "H4992",
        "content": {
          "name": "Amwaj Rotana Jumeirah Beach",
          "virginView": "Located along &#x201c;The Walk&#x201d;, Jumeirah Beach Residence, you will experience the height of comfort at Amwaj Rotana Hotel. The hotel boasts the largest rooms along the residence each with its own balcony facing the Arabian Gulf and Palm Jumeirah. Recently added family rooms make this hotel ideal for travelling with little ones, offering plenty of space and views of Ain Dubai and Bluewater Island. There are seven great dining concepts offering Italian, American/Japanese, British/American and International cuisine as well as recreational activities on the hotel grounds including the Bodylines Fitness &amp; Wellness Club and Flipper's Kids&#x2019; Club activity centre.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
          "hotelDescription": "Located along &#x201c;The Walk&#x201d;, Jumeirah Beach Residence, guests will experience the height of comfort at Amwaj Rotana Hotel. The hotel boasts the largest rooms along the residence each with its own balcony facing the Arabian Gulf and Palm Jumeirah. There are seven great dining concepts offering Italian, American/Japanese, British/American and International cuisine as well as recreational activities on the hotel grounds including the Bodylines Fitness &amp; Wellness Club and Flipper's Kids&#x2019; Club activity centre.",
