    {
      "hotel": {
        "id": "H4293",
        "content": {
          "name": "JW Marriott Marquis Dubai",
          "virginView": "The world's tallest 5-star hotel, the JW Marriott Marquis Hotel Dubai, is certainly one of the most desirable. Spread across two iconic towers, intuitive service and refined taste are benchmark qualities. Stunning views of the ocean, new Dubai canal and Downtown are complimented by only the best facilities. Rooms and suites are modern, airy and spacious with a supreme range of home comforts, but when you can tear yourself away, a visit to the sublime Saray Spa and Health Club is highly recommended. Dining at the JW Marriott Marquis Hotel Dubai is also an experience with 13 award-winning restaurants to choose from. If you want to head to the beach or enjoy some retail therapy, the hotel offers a complimentary shuttle service to Dubai Mall.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
          "hotelDescription": "Spread across two iconic towers, this desirable hotel is located near to the Burj Khalifa, Dubai Mall and Dubai Opera. Dining here is an experience with fourteen award-winning restaurants to choose from. If you want to enjoy some retail therapy, the hotel offers a complimentary shuttle service toDubai Mall.",
