    {
      "hotel": {
        "id": "H0360",
        "content": {
          "name": "Hilton Dubai Jumeirah",
          "virginView": "Set in exotic gardens beside a private stretch of beach, this is a great resort, giving you the best of everything Dubai has to offer. Hilton Dubai Jumeirah offers a stylish retreat in the heart of the JBR, overlooking the pristine white sands of the Arabian Gulf shoreline or the iconic architecture of the Marina. Try water sports from the beach, relax by the large swimming pool or visit the shopping malls nearby. Conveniently located on Jumeirah Beach and 'The Walk', a popular beachfront avenue of boutiques, al fresco restaurants and modern day Arabic culture. If you&#x2019;re in a celebratory mood, we highly recommend the fantastic Champagne cocktails at the Sky Bar. Oceana is an all-day dining buffet restaurant with themed evenings and &#xe0; la carte available. At the live cooking station, look out for succulent grilled meat or freshly baked pizzas straight from the oven. Award-winning Vero Ristorante serves authentic Italian fare overlooking the hotel gardens and beach. An Irish themed sports bar McGettigans Bar &amp; Restaurant prides itself on its warm hospitality and fantastic food and drinks. Newest Trader Vic&#x2019;s serves the world famous exotic tiki-styled cocktails and French-Polynesian cuisines. For a truly fabulous stay, opt for a high-up Executive Room with special check in and access to the Executive Lounge, where you get complimentary breakfast, drinks and snacks. Guests also have access to the facilities and dining establishments at neighbour property, Hilton Dubai The Walk, including the Pure Sky Lounge.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
          "hotelDescription": "Set in exotic gardens beside a private stretch of beach, this is a great resort, giving you the best of everything Dubai has to offer. Hilton Dubai Jumeirah offers a stylish retreat in the heart of the Dubai Marina, overlooking the pristine white sands of the Arabian Gulf shoreline or the iconic architecture of the Marina. Try water sports from the beach, relax by the large swimming pool or visit the shopping malls on the complimentary daily shuttle. Conveniently located on Jumeirah Beach and 'The Walk', a popular beachfront avenue of boutiques, al fresco restaurants and modern day Arabic culture. If you&#x2019;re in a celebratory mood, we highly recommend the fantastic Champagne cocktails at the Sky Bar. Oceana is an all-day dining buffet restaurant with themed evenings and &#xe0; la carte available. At the live cooking station, look out for succulent grilled meat or freshly baked pizzas straight from the oven. Award-winning Vero Ristorante, which has famous branches in New York and Milan, serves authentic Italian fare overlooking the hotel gardens and beach. For a truly fabulous stay, opt for a high-up Executive Room with special check-in and access to the Executive Lounge, where you get complimentary breakfast, drinks and snacks.",
          "atAGlance": [
            "Located on Jumeirah Beach and 'The Walk'",
            "An array of cuisine offered",
            "Family friendly",
            "Panoramic views over the Arabian Peninsula"
          ],
          "location": {
            "lat": 25.07919,
            "lon": 55.13406
          },
          "parentLocation": "Dubai Beach, Dubai",
