      "hotel": {
        "id": "H0364",
        "content": {
          "name": "JA Palm Tree Court",
          "virginView": "JA Palm Tree Court is part of the fabulous JA The Resort complex, tucked away in beautifully landscaped gardens. It has a low-key feel, with low-rise buildings. Best of all, every room is actually a suite, with sea or garden views. Tee off at the 9 hole championship golf course at JA The Resort, relax with an invigorating massage at the spa, explore the private marina with a fishing trip or a boat trip or saddle up for a horse back ride. Enjoy complimentary shuttles to the shopping malls. And delight your taste buds in sumptuous in any of the dining destinations. Dazzling Dubai awaits.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
          "hotelDescription": "Tucked away in beautifully landscaped gardens, JA Palm Tree Court has a relaxed feel, with low-rise buildings. Best of all, every room is actually a Junior Suite, with sea or garden views, just a few steps from the 800-metre long beach. The hotel is ideal for families with both kids&#x2019; and teens&#x2019; clubs.",
          "atAGlance": [
            "Perfect for families with extensive benefits",
            "Fabulous beach",
            "Kids' club",
            "Complimentary shuttle to shopping malls"
