        "content": {
          "name": "Radisson Resort Ras Al Khaimah Marjan Island",
          "virginView": "If your idea of a top-notch holiday includes soft sands, warm seas and zero stress, the Radisson Resort Ras Al Khaimah Marjan Island is ready to roll out the beach towel. Perched right on the shimmering shores of Marjan Island, this beachfront gem gives you all the views without rinsing your budget. So yes you can have that dream Middle East escape and still afford the ice creams. This place was made with families in mind. We&#x2019;re talking super comfy rooms, a kids&#x2019; club that keeps little ones grinning, and poolside action for all ages. There&#x2019;s even a splash park on-site. Throw in a laid-back vibe, top value for money, and a gold-star beachfront location just an hour from Dubai, and you&#x2019;ve got everything you need for your next sunshine escape.",
