    {
      "hotel": {
        "id": "JP84179856518",
        "content": {
          "name": "Hyatt Regency Dubai Creek Heights",
          "virginView": "Pack your bags and prep your Instagram feed because your next adventure at the Hyatt Regency Dubai Creek Heights is what holiday dreams are made of. Perched between the iconic Dubai Creek and the vibrant city skyline, this 5-star stunner combines luxury, style, and a location that puts you right in the middle of all the action. From the moment you step into your sleek, contemporary room, you&#x2019;ll feel like a VIP. Think floor-to-ceiling windows with jaw-dropping views of the city, plush bedding you&#x2019;ll struggle to leave, and every modern comfort you can imagine. Feeling jet-lagged? Their top-notch spa is calling your name. With treatments inspired by global traditions, you&#x2019;ll leave feeling rejuvenated and ready to hit the town. If sweating it out is more your vibe, the fully equipped fitness centre has you covered. Or just claim a lounger by the outdoor pool, because &#x201c;relaxation&#x201d; is a perfectly valid workout too. The dining options? Next level. Start your day with a feast at Sufra (hello, international buffet), sip sunset cocktails at Eve Penthouse &amp; Lounge (the views are almost too good to believe), or dive into authentic Mexican flavours at La Tablita. Basically, your tastebuds are going on holiday too. Whether you&#x2019;re a shopaholic hunting for treasures in Dubai Mall or prefer a cultural deep dive into the nearby old souks, this hotel&#x2019;s location means you can do it all &#x2013; and then retreat to your oasis of calm when you&#x2019;re done. It's the perfect balance of buzzing city energy and serene escape.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
          "hotelDescription": "",
          "atAGlance": [
            "Near Dubai Creek, offering beautiful waterfront views",
            "Home to 'it' dining and nightlife sceneries",
            "Well-appointed rooms and suites, including Regency Club rooms with exclusive lounge access"
          ],
