      "hotel": {
        "id": "JP06259Z124794",
        "content": {
          "name": "Hampton by Hilton Marjan Island",
          "virginView": "From its coveted perch on prestigious Al Marjan Island, this bright, airy and tastefully furnished hotel near Al Hamra is a perfect spot from which to enjoy a trip to Ras al Khaimah. With a pristine private beach, stunning sea views are visible throughout most of the hotel, and are best enjoyed whilst relaxing in the infinity pool, sipping a cocktail from the pool bar, or from a lounger on the pristine sand. Enjoy a variety of cuisines and refreshments from the in-house restaurants and bars, with the Lobby Lounge conveniently serving snacks and refreshments 24 hours a day. For families, there's something for everybody, with kids and teens clubs, and the option to upgrade to a spacious family room. There are plenty of handy amenities, such as free self-parking, WiFi, and a fitness centre with gorgeous views that will make your morning workouts infinitely more enjoyable. With attractions such as Al Hamra mall nearby, it's easy to make the most of your trip.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "4",
          "hotelDescription": "",
