        "content": {
          "name": "25hours Hotel Dubai One Central",
          "virginView": "Staying at 25hours Hotel Dubai One Central gives you a fresh and fun experience, different from the usual hotels in the city. If you love cool, artistic spaces, this place is full of quirky design and creativity. You&#x2019;ll enjoy rooftop views, tasty food, and unique rooms that don&#x2019;t feel cookie-cutter. Plus, it's close to major attractions like the Dubai World Trade Centre and Downtown Dubai, so you're near all the action. Whether you want to chill by the rooftop pool, relax at the spa, or hang out at the trendy Monkey Bar, the hotel offers plenty of ways to enjoy your time. It's perfect if you're looking for a stay that&#x2019;s a mix of fun, comfort, and style!",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
