              "name": "DXB Rixos The Palm Aquaventure Tickets 2023-2024",
              "description": "\u003Cb\u003EBooking Bonus:\u003C/b\u003E Guest will receive complimentary tickets to the world's largest Waterpark (T&amp;C apply), for completed stays up to 31 Dec '26, when staying a minimum of 4 nights. The number of tickets provided will match the number of guests staying per room, per night. Re-entry into the park after leaving is not permitted.\u003Cp\u003EAny applicable offers have been calculated into the prices shown. Offers may not be combinable. Blackout dates apply. Terms and conditions apply.\u003C/p\u003E",
              "salesMessageDescription": "\u003Cb\u003EBooking Bonus:\u003C/b\u003E Guest will receive complimentary tickets to the world's largest Waterpark (T&amp;C apply), for completed stays up to 31 Dec '26, when staying a minimum of 4 nights. The number of tickets provided will match the number of guests staying per room, per night. Re-entry into the park after leaving is not permitted.\u003Cp\u003EAny applicable offers have been calculated into the prices shown. Offers may not be combinable. Blackout dates apply. Terms and conditions apply.\u003C/p\u003E",
