        "content": {
          "name": "Delano Dubai",
          "virginView": "One of the newer kids on the block, The Delano brings its unique magic to Dubai! From the moment you enter its stylish, art-infused interiors, you're enveloped in an atmosphere of modern elegance.The spacious rooms, equipped with state-of-the-art amenities and breathtaking views of the Dubai skyline or Arabian Gulf, provide a perfect blend of comfort and sophistication. With gourmet dining options including The Blue Door, another Delano classic, a lively nightlife scene at Rose Bar, sparkling pool and rejuvenating spa, plus impeccable personalised service, The Delano provides a perfect balance of indulgence and relaxation, making it an ideal retreat in the heart of one of the world's most dynamic cities.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
          "hotelDescription": "",
