    {
      "hotel": {
        "id": "H2056",
        "content": {
          "name": "Grosvenor House Dubai, A Luxury Collection Hotel",
          "virginView": "Even within the sea of luxury and amazing hotels that Dubai has on offer, the Grosvenor House really stands out, setting the benchmark very high for luxury. Overlooking the exclusive Dubai Marina, the two iconic 45-storey towers offers quite an architectural statement whilst ensuring impressive views of the Arabian Gulf. The 19 stylish bars and restaurants are the talk of the Dubai social scene, offering a world of taste from Latin America and across the Mediterranean to India with multiple Michelin-starred chefs in residence. The hottest spot in Dubai, the Buddha Bar, is found at the Grosvenor. As soon as you enter this world-famous space with its monumental proportions, you&#x2019;ll be enthralled by the charm of its soothing, exotic atmosphere. The accommodation offered is that of sophisticated luxury, with beautiful rooms and suites that have nearly every amenity one could wish for. While inspired personal service is delivered with calm efficiency and a smile. The affable staff remember your name and are helpful without being overbearing, no small feat in a hotel with 45-storeys!",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
          "hotelDescription": "Even within the sea of luxury and amazing hotels that Dubai has on offer, the Grosvenor House really stands out, setting the benchmark very high for luxury. Overlooking the exclusive Dubai Marina, the two iconic 45-storey towers offers quite an architectural statement whilst ensuring impressive views of the Arabian Gulf. The 14 stylish bars and restaurants are the talk of the Dubai social scene, with the hottest spot the Buddha Bar found at the Grosvenor.",
          "atAGlance": [
            "Luxury hotel consisting of two iconic 45-storey towers",
            "Great selection of bars and restaurants",
            "Dubai Marina location",
            "Retreat Health Club &amp; Spa and B/Attitude Spa"
          ],
          "location": {
            "lat": 25.08567,
            "lon": 55.143955
          },
