    {
      "hotel": {
        "id": "ALHBE49375194",
        "content": {
          "name": "Media One Hotel",
          "virginView": "There&#x2019;s something seriously slick about Media One Hotel. It&#x2019;s like they read all the guides to creating the ultimate urban retreat: find a tip-top location (this one&#x2019;s in the heart of New Dubai), add another mirrored masterpiece to Dubai&#x2019;s famed skyline, fill it with cosmopolitan city break essentials (Gym? Tick. Dining? Tick. Nightlife? Tick.) and zhoosh it up with accessories straight from a celebrity designer&#x2019;s moodboard. Like a constant reminder of its cooler-than-cool location, your guest room looks out over the Arabian Gulf, Palm Jumeirah, or glittering Dubai skyline. And, for more eye-popping views, the tower&#x2019;s dining and drinking hubs include Garden on 8, with on-trend refectory tables and big-screen TVs, and Coco Lounge, a &#x2018;bar-meets-lounge-meets-pool&#x2019; set up, where you can slink from your swim to a poolside sofa for skyline views, cocktails, and chillout beats.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "4",
          "hotelDescription": "There&#x2019;s something seriously slick about Media One Hotel. For eye-popping views, the tower&#x2019;s dining and drinking hubs include Garden on 8, with on-trend refectory tables and big-screen TVs, and Coco Lounge, a &#x2018;bar-meets-lounge-meets-pool&#x2019; set up, where you can slink from your swim to a poolside sofa for skyline views, cocktails, and chillout beats.",
          "atAGlance": [
            "Exclusive bucket of beers for Virgin Atlantic Holidays customers",
            "Popular location in \"New Dubai\"",
