    {
      "hotel": {
        "id": "JP262941124794",
        "content": {
          "name": "Pullman Resort Al Marjan Island ",
          "virginView": "Welcome to Pullman Resort Al Marjan Island &#x2013; a beachfront escape where golden sands, modern style, and a relaxed pace come together. Set on Ras Al Khaimah&#x2019;s first man-made island, this resort offers a peaceful break from everyday life, with the Arabian Gulf just steps away.\nSpend your days unwinding on the private beach or cooling off in one of the three outdoor pools, with an indoor option for quieter moments. Families are well looked after with the Pirates Club for kids, while adults can enjoy time to themselves or a drink by the water.\nWhen it&#x2019;s time to eat, the resort&#x2019;s restaurants and caf&#xe9;s serve a mix of international dishes, fresh seafood, and Middle Eastern favourites. Rooms and suites are spacious, featuring comfortable beds and balconies with sea or island views. Plus,&#xa0;if you&#x2019;re in the mood to explore, Ras Al Khaimah has plenty to offer &#x2013; from desert landscapes and historic forts to long stretches of coastline &#x2013; all just 45 minutes from Dubai.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "4",
          "hotelDescription": "",
          "atAGlance": [
            "Family-friendly, beachfront hotel",
            "Exclusive Virgin Atlantic Holidays All-Inclusive option",
            "Private beach plus three swimming pools",
            "Choice of 6 restaurants"
          ],
