      "hotel": {
        "id": "ALHBE105475194",
        "content": {
          "name": "Rove Downtown Dubai",
          "virginView": "Delivering photo ops of Burj Khalifa, Rove Downtown doesn&#x2019;t just place you near this sky-piercing landmark, it&#x2019;s also just a walk from The Dubai Mall, The Dubai Fountain, and attractions like Kidzania, Dubai Aquarium and Underwater Zoo. In fact, as its name implies, it&#x2019;s the perfect pied-a-terre for roaming around downtown Dubai. You can return to base to swim in its outdoor pool, unwind on its sun deck, or work out in its 24-hour gym. And, if you&#x2019;re not dining out, FRIDAY&#x2019;S features a fabulous fusion of Arabic, Western, Indian, and Southeast Asian dishes, along with weekend brunches (and takeaways if you&#x2019;re eager to keep exploring). Being a &#x2018;rover&#x2019;s&#x2019; rest stop, it has plenty of handy essentials too, like the 24-hour laundromat, 24-hour boutique, and complimentary WiFi in your spacious room (which you get to stay in until 2:00pm on your last day).",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "3",
