        "content": {
          "name": "Marriott Resort Palm Jumeirah",
          "virginView": "The Marriott Resort Palm Jumeirah in Dubai stands as a luxurious oasis nestled within the iconic Palm Jumeirah. This stunning beachfront property combines modern sophistication with Arabian charm, offering a truly indulgent holiday experience. The resort boasts a range of well-appointed rooms and suites, each designed to provide breathtaking views of the Arabian Gulf or the city skyline. With an emphasis on world-class amenities, the Marriott Resort Palm Jumeirah features multiple swimming pools, a private beach, and a spa. Culinary enthusiasts will find themselves delighted by the diverse dining options, from authentic Middle Eastern cuisine to international delights. The hotel's location provides easy access to Dubai's attractions, making it an ideal choice for both leisure and business travellers seeking a lavish escape in this dynamic city.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
