        "content": {
          "name": "Sofitel Al Hamra Beach Resort",
          "virginView": "Discover a journey into luxury and tranquility at Sofitel Al Hamra Beach Resort, just an hour from Dubai International Airport. The beachfront resort boasts stunning ocean views and elegantly designed rooms and suites that blend modern comforts with traditional charm. Days can be spent lounging by pristine pools, indulging in gourmet dining experiences, or rejuvenating at the world-class spa. Travelling with children? The resort provides family-friendly facilities including kids' clubs, children's pools, and family rooms to cater to your every need. With personalised service and a wealth of recreational activities, from water sports to cultural excursions, every moment at the resort promises relaxation and adventure, creating an unforgettable coastal escape in Ras Al Khaimah.",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "5",
