        "content": {
          "name": "Centara Mirage Beach Resort Dubai",
          "virginView": "This is the first of the Centara resorts in the UAE, and they&#x2019;ve pulled out all the stops to create the ultimate family themed family resort to make your dream holiday come true. Inspired by mythical Thai and magical Arabian adventures, everything has been taken into consideration when it comes to suiting family trips, with interconnecting rooms and bunk beds available for all family sizes, and there&#x2019;s even a childrens spa to sit alongside the adults one, so they can have their fair share of pampering too &#x2013; after all, it&#x2019;s tiring going down the water slides all day long! If you want to add that extra touch to your stay, upgrade to a Mirage room for access to the Family club lounge, complete with family-friendly check-in and a kids&#x2019; play area. It will be hard to pull them away from the adventure water park for food though, complete with water slides, high ropes, and a lazy river &#x2013; it&#x2019;s unlikely you&#x2019;ll see much of them in the day, especially with the E-zone too. If this is the case, sneak away to the rooftop bar and enjoy a sundowner cocktail or a spot of shisha before dinner, overlooking the Arabian gulf.&#xa0;",
          "telephoneBookableOnly": false,
          "vRating": "4",
          "hotelDescription": "",
          "atAGlance": [
            "A themed family-oriented resort on a prime stretch of the Dubai Islands waterfront",
            "Multiple kids&#x2019; clubs plus Mirage Family Lounge, Virtual Sport experience, and Candy Spa",
            "Wine and dine at 7 different venues",
            "Water attractions, including a lazy river, water slides, cliff jumping points and bouncy castle"
          ],
          "location": {
            "lat": 25.30145,
            "lon": 55.30396
          },
